# The plus preset with Humid Start, header climate, humidifier hold and the
# climate graph. Fall Time, Square Wave, AutoEPAP and ASV backup rate are left
# out, and the Start Coupling row is not added, so that every other setting
# gets a menu slot and the settings registry fits.
--preset plus
--patch-fall-time n
--patch-fw-squarewave n
--patch-autoepap n
--patch-fw-asv-wrapper n
--patch-humid-start y
--humid-start-coupling-row n
--patch-header-climate y
--patch-humidifier-hold y
--patch-graph-climate y
